            "review_title": "Review at Juugoya Geihinkan",
            "review_text": "Thai Ngan V\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam6 contributions\n1\nGood place to visit for lunch or dinner\nOct 2015 • Business\n- I love the way they set up stuffs for decoration, so Janpan. It is unlike some other reataurants have been combined too much between traditional Japan and other culture in design, this Juugoya Geihinkan (15th Night) brings you feeling of full Japan from the front door, outside sign, inside room set-up, atmosphere, decoration and staff's uniform. It is so funny that our colleagues were so interested in the restroom here, modern and clean at all. \n- About the food, actually I hope it can be a bit more diversity in sushi menu.\n- For improvement, in my opinion, there should be built up more green view out side the window, re-design the water system outside (I don't know their purpose of this water pipes outside, maybe for decoration) yah!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 29, 2015",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
