            "review_text": "Nioaloneson\n1 contribution\n0\nIts nice\nMay 2014 • Friends\nFirst time visited this place, the food its nice, decor its pretty, but tempura a little soft not crispy. Totally Im satisfied. The price its middle high, cost for each person around 300k to 1m.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 2, 2014\nJuugoya_Geihinkan\nDear Nioaloneson,\n\nThank you for coming to our restaurant, we really do appreciate your business. We are sorry you were not pleased with the quality of tempura on your last visit. We stand behind our food, and if you are not satisfied for any reason, please let your server know as soon as possible during the meal so they can address your concerns. We hope you decide to come back, we have many delicious offerings for you to choose from. Again, we appreciate your business, thank you.\n\nBest regards,\nSato, owner of Juugoya Geihinkan\njuugoya@fullmoon.com.vn\nRead more\nWritten May 4, 2014\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
